{
  "slug": "artist:a-s-y-s",
  "name": "A*S*Y*S",
  "editorial_article": "A*S*Y*S is a German music project, established by producers Frank Ellrich and Kai Franz, that specializes in a hybrid of techno, acid, and hardtechno. The project, often associated with the alias Frank Ellrich, has been active in the dance music scene with various releases found on platforms like Discogs. Their work frequently incorporates hard-hitting rhythmic structures and acid synthesis. A*S*Y*S has garnered attention through a range of remixes and original productions, collaborating with artists including Alex Kidd, Audiofreq, and Kai Tracid. The project has also explored reinterpretations of classic material, including a notable cover of a track originally released in the early 1980s by the Berlin indie-punk group Ideal.",
